{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"85178673aa1b8f4f59166e042dd1f8eca3a7c3393527850eb9a97150672c5b13","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1267},"chapter":{"number":24,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["巴蘭第三次預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["巴蘭見耶和華樂意賜福給以色列人，就不再像先前兩次那樣去求兆頭，而是轉向曠野。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他舉目眺望，看見以色列人按支派紮營。上帝的靈降在他身上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他便吟詩預言說：",{"text":"「比珥之子巴蘭的預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是眼睛明亮者的話，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他得聽上帝之言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"俯伏在地，眼目睜開","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得見全能者的異象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的帳篷何等華美！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的居所何等佳美！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像連綿的山谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如河畔的園子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像耶和華栽種的沉香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如水邊的香柏樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們沐浴充沛的甘霖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒種於濕潤的沃土。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的君王高過亞甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"國度名震四方。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝帶他們出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂","poem":1},{"noteId":11},{"text":"的力量如野牛之角。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要吞滅敵國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎敵人的骨頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用利箭射穿仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們蹲伏如雄獅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"躺臥如母獅，誰敢招惹？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願祝福他們的人蒙祝福！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願咒詛他們的人受咒詛！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["巴勒聽了大怒，用力擊掌，對巴蘭說：「我請你來咒詛我的仇敵，你竟三次祝福他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["現在快回家去吧！我說過要給你重賞，但耶和華不讓你得到。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["巴蘭說：「我不是對你派來的使臣說過嗎？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["就是你把滿屋的金銀都給我，我也不能違背耶和華的命令、憑自己的意思行事——無論好事壞事。我只能說耶和華讓我說的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["現在我要回本族去了。但我要告訴你日後以色列人會怎樣對待你的人民。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴蘭第四次預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["巴蘭吟詩預言說：",{"text":"「比珥之子巴蘭的預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是眼睛明亮者的話，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他得聽上帝之言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"明白至高者的旨意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"俯伏在地，眼目睜開，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得見全能者的異象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所見的尚未發生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我目睹的關乎將來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一顆星要從雅各家升起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一位君王要從以色列興起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要打爛摩押的前額，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擊碎塞特人的頭顱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必征服以東，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佔領敵疆西珥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列必勇往直前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的後裔必掌權，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"消滅城中的餘民。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴蘭最後的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["巴蘭觀看亞瑪力人，並以詩歌預言說：",{"text":"「亞瑪力原是列國之首，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他的結局卻是滅亡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["巴蘭又觀看基尼人，並以詩歌預言說：",{"text":"「雖然你的居所堅固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的巢築在峭壁，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你必遭滅頂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被亞述擄去。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["巴蘭又以詩歌預言說：",{"text":"「唉！若上帝做這事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能存活呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"船隻從基提駛來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"征服亞述和希伯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他也要滅亡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["說完，巴蘭動身返回家鄉，巴勒也回去了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"「祂」或譯「他們」。","reference":{"chapter":24,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/24.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/25.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NUM/23.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}